# Tripo 3D assets

When creating, rebuilding, or debugging **Tripo / GLB** meshes (cars, Teile, FX, track kit, garage props, nose ornaments):

1. Read `.cursor/skills/tripo-3d-assets/SKILL.md` (and `pipeline.md` when baking)
2. Also read `.cursor/skills/asphalt-comic-art/` for concept images
3. Do not remount Blitz part kits on other car classes
